\v 1 \add ≈When\add* Sha'ul's¦143674 son¦143672 \add Iysh-Boshet\add* heard that¦143675 Abner¦143677 had¦143676 \add ≈been killed\add* in¦143678 Hebron¦143678, \add ≈he¦143676 lost courage\add* and all¦143681 Yisrael¦143683 was horrified.
\v 2 \add *He\add* had two¦143686 men¦143687 who were \add ≈leaders of raiding parties\add*. They¦143691 were Rimmon's¦143702 sons¦143701 Baanah¦143697 and¦143686 Rekav¦143700 from¦143704 Beerot¦143709 in the¦143704 Benyamite region,
