\v 4 (Sha'ul's¦143730 son Yonatan had a son named Mefiboshet. He¦143738 was¦143738 \add ≈five¦143736 years¦143737 old\add* when¦143739 the¦143740 report¦143740 about¦143728 Sha'ul and Yonatan's¦143727 \add death\add* came¦143739 from¦143743 Yezreel¦143743. \add @Mefiboshet's\add* \add ≈nanny\add* picked¦143744 him¦143744 up \add ≈to run to safety, but¦143727 in her hurry\add* he fell¦143750 and \add ≈became¦143751 crippled in his¦143752 legs\add*.)\x + \xo 4:4: \xt 2Sam 9:3.\x*
