\v 5 \add One day,\add* Baanah¦143761 and¦143755 Rekav¦143760 (the sons¦143756 of Rimmon¦143758 from Beerot) walked to Iysh-Boshet's house¦143767, \add ≈arriving in the middle of the day when he¦143770 was¦143771 taking a nap\add*.
