\v 8 They¦143820 took Iysh-Boshet's head to David¦143829 at Hebron¦143830 and told the king, “Look, \add here's\add* the head of Ishbosheth, the son¦143841 of your¦143844 enemy¦143844 Sha'ul who¦143845 \add ≈tried to kill you\add*. Today Yahweh's¦143851 given¦143850 vengeance¦143854 to my¦143852 master¦143852 the king against Sha'ul and his¦143858 \add ≈descendants\add*.”
