\v 17 \add ≈When\add* the Philistines¦144255 heard that¦144256 David had¦144258 been \add ≈proclaimed\add* as king¦144262 over¦144263 \add all\add* Yisrael¦144265, \add ≈their army set off to capture\add* \add *him\add*, \add ≈but\add* David heard and \add ≈retreated\add*\f + \fr 5:17 \ft The Hebrew says ‘descended’, but doesn't tell us either from where (probably Yerushalem) or to where (possibly Masada).\f* to the stronghold¦144279.
