\v 6 \add ≈But¦144505\add* when they¦144505 reached Nakon's¦144515 threshing¦144508 floor¦144508 the oxen \add ≈stumbled¦144519 so\add* Uzzah¦144511 reached out¦144510 \add ≈to¦144512 steady the sacred chest¦144514\add*.
