\v 11 The \add ≈sacred chest¦144593\add* stayed at Obed¦144596-Edom's¦144597 house¦144595 for three¦144599 months¦144600, and Yahweh¦144594 blessed¦144601 him and all¦144609 \add ≈the household\add*.\x + \xo 6:11: \xt 1Ch 26:4-5.\x*
\p
\v 12 \add ≈Someone told¦144613\add* King¦144614 David, “Yahweh¦144618 has¦144617 blessed¦144617 Obed-Edom's \add ≈household¦144621\add* because of the \add ≈sacred chest¦144632,” so\add* David went¦144634 and¦144613 brought God's Box from¦144641 Obed-Edom's house¦144641 to \add ≈Yerushalem with¦144646 much happiness\add*.
