\v 16 \add ≈However\add*, as they were entering the city¦144691, \add @David's¦144692\add* wife Mikal¦144693 (Sha'ul's¦144696 daughter¦144694) looked¦144697 out the window¦144700 and saw¦144701 King¦144704 David leaping¦144706 and dancing¦144707 \add ≈in¦144712 front¦144708 of\add* Yahweh¦144689, and she¦144697 \add ≈felt only despite¦144710 for\add* him¦144711.
