\v 8 “\add ≈But¦144994\add* now¦144994 you should tell my servant¦144998 David¦144999 that commander¦145003 Yahweh¦145002 says¦145001, ‘I¦145004 myself took¦145005 you out of the \add ≈grass field where you looked after¦145009 the sheep¦145010 and¦144994 goats\add* to¦145011 become the leader¦145012 of my people¦145015 the \add ≈Israelis¦145015\add*.
\v 9 Everywhere you've gone¦145024, I've¦145020 been¦145020 with¦145022 you and \add ≈destroyed your¦145031 enemies¦145030 in¦145022 front¦145031 of you\add*, and I will¦145032 make¦145032 you \add ≈famous like¦145036 all the famous\add* people on¦145022 the earth¦145039.
