\p
\v 17 \add ≈So\add* Natan¦145176 \add ≈passed all of that¦145173 onto\add* David¦145179,
\v 18 and King¦145183 David¦145184 went¦145182 and sat¦145185 \add ≈in¦145186 front¦145186\add* of¦145186 Yahweh and said¦145188, “Who¦145189 am¦145190 I¦145190, my master¦145191 Yahweh, and \add ≈how important is¦145194 my family\add* that you¦145196 have¦145196 brought¦145196 me¦145196 to¦145197 \add ≈this point\add*?
\v 19 \add ≈But¦145201 that¦145203 was¦145201 just minor to you¦145207,\add* my master¦145205 Yahweh¦145205. You¦145207 also¦145208 spoke¦145207 about¦145214 \add ≈the distant¦145214 future for my descendants\add*.
\v 20 What¦145221 more can \add I,\add* David¦145224 say¦145226 to you? \add ≈But¦145221\add* my master¦145233 Yahweh¦145233, you yourself know¦145229 your¦145232 servant¦145232.
