\v 22 That's¦145255 why you're¦145253 incredible, Yahweh¦145254 my god¦145261, \add ≈and¦145260 so\add* there's¦145258 no one like¦145259 you. There's¦145250 no god¦145261 except¦145262 you—\add ≈that's¦145264 what we¦145266 keep hearing¦145266 about¦145267\add*.
\v 23 \add ≈What other nation\add* is¦145270 like¦145270 your people, Yisrael¦145271—one nation on¦145274 the¦145274 earth¦145274 that¦145275 \add *you\add* went¦145276 to redeem¦145279 for \add ≈yourself\add* as a people—\add ≈rescuing\add* you from Egypt¦145296 and its¦145298 gods¦145298? \add You\add* \add ≈made¦145283 a reputation¦145285 for yourself\add* and \add ≈did¦145286 amazing and scary things for your nation in¦145291 front¦145291\add* of your people\x + \xo 7:23: \xt Deu 4:34.\x*
\v 24 You¦145306 established¦145300 \add us\add* Israelis¦145304 as your¦145304 \add own\add* people¦145304 forever¦145312, and¦145300 you yourself¦145308 Yahweh¦145314 became¦145315 \add ≈our\add* God¦145317.
\p
\v 25 “And¦145320 now¦145320, Yahweh¦145321 God¦145322, the \add ≈promise you made\add* concerning¦145329 your¦145328 servant¦145328 and his¦145331 \add ≈descendants\add*, and do¦145336 just¦145337 as¦145337 you have¦145338 spoken¦145338 and \add ≈make it come true into the future\add*.
