\v 27 because¦145359 you, commander¦145363 Yahweh¦145362 are Yisrael's¦145365 god¦145364. You¦145366 have¦145366 \add ≈told\add* your servant, ‘I¦145373 will¦145373 build¦145373 a \add ≈dynasty\add* for¦145375 you.’ \add ≈That's why\add* your servant has¦145379 found¦145379 \add ≈the courage\add* to pray¦145384 this¦145389 prayer¦145388.
\p
\v 28 “\add ≈So¦145391\add* now¦145391, my¦145393 master¦145393 Yahweh¦145393, you are God¦145398, and \add ≈you do what you say\add*, and you have¦145402 said these good¦145408 things¦145408 concerning your¦145405 servant¦145405.
\v 29 Now¦145425, \add ≈if it¦145428 pleases you,\add* bless¦145413 your servant's \add ≈extended family\add* forever, because¦145421 you yourself, my¦145424 master¦145424 Yahweh¦145424, have¦145426 spoken¦145426, and¦145411 from¦145427 your blessing¦145427, your servant's \add ≈family\add* will¦145428 be¦145428 blessed¦145428 forever.”
