\p
\v 1 \add ≈Sometime later,\add* David¦145440 \add ≈attacked\add* the¦145443 Philistines¦145443 and \add ≈defeated¦145439\add* them, and he¦145445 \add ≈captured\add* Meteg-Ammah from¦145451 \add ≈them\add*.
\p
\v 2 Then¦145454 he \add ≈defeated¦145454\add* the \add ≈Moabites\add*. \add @David\add* forced them to lie¦145460 on¦145459 the ground and \add ≈used a length of rope to decide their fate—those inside two¦145464 lengths of the rope were killed, and those inside the third length were spared\add* and \add so\add* the Moabites became¦145471 David's¦145473 servants¦145474—bringing¦145475 him tribute¦145476.
