\v 5 Then¦145520 \add ≈the Arameans¦145529\add* came¦145520 from Damascus¦145522 to help¦145523 Tsovah's¦145526 king¦145525 Hadadezer¦145524 \add ≈but¦145520\add* David¦145528 \add ≈killed¦145527\add* twenty-two¦145530 thousand¦145533 \add ≈of¦145525 them\add*.
