\v 12 from Aram and Moab¦145654, from the \add ≈Ammonites¦145656\add* and the Philistines¦145657, and from Amalak and from the plunder¦145659 of Tsovah's¦145665 King¦145664 Hadadezer¦145660 (son¦145661 of Rehov¦145663).
\p
\v 13 Then¦145667 David¦145668 made¦145667 \add more of\add* a name¦145669 \add for himself\add* when¦145670 he¦145670 returned¦145670 from¦145671 \add ≈defeating¦145671 eighteen¦145678 thousand¦145680 Arameans¦145674\add* in¦145670 the¦145675 Salt¦145677 Valley¦145675.\x + \xo 8:13: \xt Psa 60 header.\x*
\v 14 He \add ≈stationed\add* garrisons \add ≈throughout\add* Edom¦145683 and \add made the people\add* his servants, and Yahweh¦145697 \add ≈protected\add* David¦145695 wherever¦145702 \add ≈they fought\add*.
