\v 15 \add ≈So¦145705\add* David¦145706 \add ≈reigned¦145705\add* over¦145707 all Yisrael¦145711 and \add ≈led all his¦145719 people¦145719 with\add* justice¦145715 and \add ≈integrity\add*.
