\p
\v 1 \add ≈One day\add* David¦145759 \add ≈asked\add*, “Is there¦145761 still¦145763 anyone remaining from Sha'ul's¦145767 \add ≈extended family because¦145760 I'd like to show kindness to them\add* for Yonatan's¦145772 sake?”\x + \xo 9:1: \xt 1Sam 20:15-17.\x*
