\v 4 “Where¦145819 is¦145820 he¦145815?” the¦145818 king¦145818 asked.
\p “\add ≈Actually,\add*” Tsiva¦145822 told the king, “he's¦145828 at¦145834 Makir's¦145830 house¦145829—the son¦145831 of Ammiel¦145833 in¦145834 Lo¦145834-Debar.”
