\v 6 Then¦145849 Yonatan's¦145853 son Mefiboshet came¦145849 to David and fell¦145860 onto \add ≈his knees and bowed¦145864 his face¦145863 down¦145864 to the ground\add*, and David said¦145865, Mefiboshet.”
\p “I'm your¦145870 servant¦145870,” he¦145868 \add ≈replied\add*.
