\v 7 Then¦145872 David¦145874 told him¦145873, “Don't¦145875 be¦145877 afraid¦145877, because¦145883 I'll certainly¦145879 \add ≈show you\add* kindness for the sake of your father Yonatan¦145884. I'll restore¦145886 all the pastureland that belonged to your grandfather Sha'ul¦145893, and¦145872 you yourself¦145887 \add ≈are invited to always eat¦145896 at¦145883\add* my¦145900 table¦145900.”
