\p
\v 9 Then¦145916 the king¦145917 summoned Sha'ul's¦145922 servant¦145921 Tsiva¦145920 and told him¦145924, “I've¦145932 given¦145932 everything that¦145926 belonged¦145927 to Sha'ul and to all¦145929 his¦145931 \add ≈household¦145931\add* to your¦145935 master¦145935.
