\v 37 \add ≈But\add* Abshalom¦148350 \add had\add* fled¦148351, and¦148350 he¦148351 went¦148352 to Geshur¦148361 to stay with King¦148360 Ammihud's¦148358 son, Talmay¦148355. \add ≈But\add* \add @David\add* mourned¦148362 for his¦148365 son every day.\x + \xo 13:37: \xt 2Sam 3:3.\x*
