\v 14 \add ≈So¦149403\add* David¦149404 told his¦149407 servants¦149407, “\add ≈Pack up quickly and let's¦149413 get out of here, or else we won't¦149415 be able\add* to escape¦149420 from Abshalom¦149422. \add ≈Be fast in¦149411 case he's heading here soon\add* and overtakes¦149428 us. \add ≈That would be a massacre and the whole city¦149435 would die from their swords¦149438\add*.”
