\v 15 “Your¦149453 servants¦149441 \add here\add* \add ≈will¦149454 do everything you tell us\add*,” they¦149440 \add ≈replied\add* to the king.
\v 16 \add ≈So¦149464\add* the king¦149457 left ten¦149465 of his slave-wives to \add ≈look after\add* the palace, \add ≈but¦149456\add* he left with¦149461 all his family.
