\v 21 “\add ≈As¦149571 Yahweh¦149573 lives, and¦149563 as my master the king lives\add*,” Ittai¦149564 answered¦149563 the king, “\add ≈wherever¦149579 my master the king goes\add*, your¦149596 servant¦149596 will certainly be there \add also\add*, whether¦149586 \add ≈it means life¦149591 or death¦149588\add*.”
