\v 22 “\add Okay,\add* go \add ≈ahead then¦149598\add*,” David told Ittai. \add ≈So¦149598\add* Ittai and all¦149608 his¦149610 men¦149610 and \add ≈their families went with¦149615 David\add*.
\v 23 \add ≈All the people along the road¦149639 cried when they saw them walking by\add*. The king¦149627 and all¦149631 the others crossed the Kidron¦149630 riverbed¦149629 and went up the hill toward the wilderness¦149642.
