\v 24 \add ≈What a sight!\add* Even Tsadok¦149647 and all the Levites¦149650 with him¦149651 were¦149652 carrying¦149652 the box¦149655 with God's agreement¦149656 \add in it\add*, and when they¦149658 put it down¦149658 \add again\add*, \add the priest\add* Evyatar caught up \add to them and waited\add* until¦149665 all the people¦149670 had finished¦149667 \add exiting\add* the city¦149674.
