\v 26 \add ≈But¦149698\add* if¦149698 \add @Yahweh\add* says¦149700 that he isn't¦149701 pleased with¦149710 me, then¦149698 he'll¦149700 do¦149705 to¦149707 me \add ≈whatever he thinks best\add*.
