\v 32 \add ≈When¦149803\add* David¦149804 \add ≈reached the summit¦149808\add* (where¦149809 people \add frequently\add* worship God¦149813), Hushay¦149816 (the Arkite¦149817) met¦149815 him¦149815 there¦149812. He¦149814 had torn¦149818 his clothes and¦149803 put dirt on¦149821 his head¦149823.
