\v 36 \add Also\add* Tsadok's¦149885 son Ahimaats¦149884 and Evyatar's son Yonatan¦149886 are¦149881 there¦149880. \add ≈Tell them everything¦149891\add* you¦149895 hear¦149895, then send¦149888 \add ≈them to report it to me¦149890\add*.
