\v 37 \add ≈So¦149897\add* David's¦149900 friend¦149899 Hushay¦149898 \add ≈slipped back into\add* Yerushalem¦149904 \add ≈just as\add* Abshalom¦149902 was entering the city¦149901.
\c 16
\s1 Dishonest Tsiva helps David
