\v 4 “Well then¦149981,” the¦149982 king¦149982 told Tsiva¦149983, “everything that¦149987 belonged¦149988 to Mefiboshet now belongs to you.”
\p “\add ≈I'm honoured\add*,” Tsiva \add ≈responded¦149981\add*, “that I've found¦149994 favour¦149996 in¦149997 the eyes¦149997 of¦149997 my¦149998 master¦149998 the king.”
\s1 Shimei curses David
