\p
\v 1 \add ≈Now there¦152842 was\add* a good-for-nothing Benyaminite man¦152844 named Sheva¦152847 who was Bikri's son¦152848, and¦152861 he blasted¦152853 on¦152854 the trumpet¦152854, then said¦152855,
