\v 14 \add Meanwhile\add* \add @Sheva\add* crossed through all the¦153167 \add ≈tribal regions\add* of¦153167 Yisrael¦153168 to Avel¦153169-Beyt¦153170-Maacah \add ≈where all his relatives gathered together and¦153164 agreed to back him¦153181\add*.
\v 15 \add @Yoav's¦153202 men\add* arrived and Avel¦153186-Beyt-Maacah. They heaped a siege¦153184 ramp up against¦153191 the city¦153193, and \add also\add* \add ≈pounded\add* the wall¦153205 to \add try to make it\add* \add ≈collapse\add*.
\v 16 Then¦153207 a¦153208 wise¦153209 woman¦153208 called¦153207 out from¦153210 the¦153212 city¦153212, “Listen¦153213, listen¦153214, please¦153217 tell Yoav¦153220 to come closer \add ≈so¦153225 I¦153225 can speak¦153225 to him\add*.”
\v 17 \add @Yoav\add* \add ≈went¦153228 in closer\add* and¦153228 \add *she¦153230\add* asked, “Are¦153232 you¦153232 Yoav?”
\p “I¦153235 am¦153235,” he¦153241 \add ≈replied\add*.
