\p “I'm¦153235 listening¦153242,” he \add ≈answered\add*.
\p
\v 18 Then¦153245 she¦153245 told him, “\add ≈Long ago people used to tell others to come here to Avel¦153253 to get advice, and they'd do that and then¦153245 be able to settle the matter\add*.
\v 19 I'm¦153257 a peaceable¦153258 and faithful¦153259 \add ≈citizen\add* of Yisrael. You're \add ≈trying\add* to¦153263 destroy¦153263 \add &this\add* city¦153264 and a mother¦153265 in¦153266 Yisrael. Why would you¦153268 \add ≈wipe out our\add* inheritance¦153269 from Yahweh¦153270?”
\p
