\v 5 “That man¦153512 who \add ≈crushed\add* us,” they¦153508 \add ≈replied\add*, “and¦153515 who intended \add ≈that¦153515 we¦153519 be annihilated from¦153520 within\add* Yisrael's¦153524 borders,
\v 6 give¦153543 us¦153529 seven¦153530 \add ≈of his¦153532 descendants¦153532\add* and¦153533 we'll¦153533 hang them before Yahweh in¦153535 Gibeah¦153535 \add ?≈where Yahweh's¦153534 chosen¦153537 king¦153541 Sha'ul¦153536 lived\add*.
