\v 10 Then¦153630 Ayyah's¦153634 daughter¦153632 Ritsfah¦153631 took¦153630 sackcloth¦153637 and she¦153630 spread¦153638 it¦153630 on the rock¦153642 \add where the corpses were\add*. She¦153630 \add ≈kept the birds away during the\add* day¦153660 and the animals¦153663 at night¦153665—\add ≈staying there\add* from¦153643 the beginning of the harvest¦153644 until¦153645 \add ≈the beginning of the rainy season\add*.
